41676::$$$message_0326_0000_0000$$$::"'Saber's butt, #2.[lr]::
41677::$$$message_0326_0000_0001$$$::Rin's underwear portrait was first used on a phone card.[br]::
41678::$$$message_0326_0000_0002$$$::By the way, she doesn't always wear these.'"::
41679::$$$message_0326_0001_0000$$$::"Hehehe. You like butts that much?"::
41680::$$$message_0326_0002_0000$$$::"I'll also add that my underwear (Left) art was on a phone card that came as a retail bonus when FSN first came out."[br]::
41681::$$$message_0326_0003_0000$$$::"Saber's unladylike portrait (Center Right) is one of the[br]standing illustrations added in [font italic=true]Hollow Ataraxia[font italic=false]."::
41682::$$$message_0326_0004_0000$$$::"...R-[wvl canskip=0 time=400]Rin...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]aren't you embarrassed?"::
41683::$$$message_0326_0005_0000$$$::"Heck yeah, I am![wvl canskip=0 time=400] You jerk![wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=8] You dummy!"::

